{"version":"http://ipuz.org/v1","kind":["http://ipuz.org/crossword#1"],"title":"Senpunkte","copyright":"© 2026","author":"","notes":"La steleto \"*\" signifas ke tiuj indikoj apartenas al la ĉefa parto de la enigmo. Solvu ĉiun indikon kun steleto kiel unu esprimo.\n\n4H mallongigas 4-Horizontale kaj vi legu tion kiel la solvon de 4-Horizontale enmetitan en la indiko.","dimensions":{"height":5,"width":5},"block":"#","empty":0,"puzzle":[["#","#",{"cell":1},{"cell":2},{"cell":3}],[{"cell":4},{"cell":5},{"cell":0},{"cell":0},{"cell":0}],[{"cell":6},{"cell":0},{"cell":0},{"cell":0},{"cell":0}],[{"cell":7},{"cell":0},{"cell":0},{"cell":0},{"cell":0}],[{"cell":8},{"cell":0},{"cell":0},"#","#"]],"solution":[["#","#","S","E","K"],["E","F","I","K","O"],["T","E","M","A","S"],["A","B","I","S","M"],["P","R","I","#","#"]],"clues":{"Across":[[1,"Mank' de akvo"],[4,"Rezulto"],[6,"*La afero estas"],[7,"Fremda amin'"],[8,"*La afero estas"]],"Down":[[1,"Papagi (korpe)"],[2,"Komenciĝas"],[3,"Stelej'"],[4,"Vojaĝer'"],[5,"Kontraŭ-gripa reag'"]]}}